{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkcf8g1S46nCWdpNshdL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll tell my son: \"At my age they let you take the money out after 3 years, and the page says that's without tax. For everyone else it's 6 years. How much I'd have I couldn't really work out. The page used an example of 300 ₪ a month from me and 900 ₪ from the employer, and I took away about 54,000 put in over 5 years, with something like 66,000 at the end. Next to it there was a red '−13,974' for tax that frightened me. Before I sign anything I'll ask you or the woman at the bank.\"\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. **First screen:** \"קרן השתלמות\", \"חיסכון דרך מקום העבודה… אחרי תקופה שקבע החוק אפשר למשוך בלי מס\". It's about saving, so I stayed. In \"מה זה\" I read \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך… בלי מס\" and \"למי שהגיע לגיל הפרישה מספיקות 3 שנים\". That's me, so 3 years.\n2. **Second screen:** I understood that you can take money out before 6 years but then you pay tax. Then came buttons with \"S&P 500\" and \"מדד\". That's English letters, and I didn't press them. I did notice \"אג\"ח ממשלתית\", which I know.\n3. **The calculator:** boxes with 2.5% from me, 7.5% from the employer, 7% \"תשואה\" and 0.54% \"דמי ניהול\". There was a chart of coloured bars with a pink \"מס\" over the first five years. I didn't try to read it. Below it was \"300 ₪ בחודש מכם, 900 ₪ מהמעסיק\", then \"+54,000\", \"+8,487\", a red \"−13,974\", and a number cut off at \"66,5…\" behind a round button.\n4. **The text under it:** \"משיכה אחרי 5 שנים: לחשבון נכנסים קודם 50,719 ₪… 29,768 ₪ למס… 15,794 ₪ מהם חוזרים\". I read it twice and still didn't understand how much I'd get. 7% a year is \"הנחות של האתר, לא תחזית\", so it isn't promised.\n5. **\"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע\":** I skimmed these. You can move the fund to another company. Two names I know were there, הראל and אלטשולר שחם, and it says the companies are \"בפיקוח רשות שוק ההון\". That calmed me a bit.\n6. **Screen six:** I stopped at \"משיכה ומעבר\" (\"עד 4 ימי עסקים\"). I was tired, and I didn't read the rest of the page.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** \"S&P500\", \"מדד\" (to me that's the price index on the news), \"מסלול מדד\", \"תשואה\", \"KH-19\", \"PF-18\", \"חוקים וכללים · 10\", and \"כל הסכומים בכסף של היום\". I also don't see why it's 29,768 to tax and then 15,794 coming back.\n\n**What was hard to read:** The whole page is dark, light writing on black. The small grey line under the chart (\"גררו את הסמן…\") and the grey labels were hard to make out. The round arrow button covered the last number.\n\n**Where I got worried:** The red minus and the striped pink box. The calculator shows 5 years when it opens, before the tax-free point, so the first thing I saw was money being taken. I'd change it to open at 6 years, put one plain sentence like \"after 6 years you'd have about X\", and drop the English letters."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3787,"cache_read_input_tokens":11479,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3787},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"007471e5-3ea5-494b-bb52-d87ec829636a","uuid":"f2bb925f-29e1-4427-9896-cb59f10890cd","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:03:15.274Z","request_id":"req_011Cgkcf8Jw2sCXDb7TB2ruj"}
